@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Operation and job knowledge states
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> Queued
Queued --> Running : current guarded claim and eligibility
Queued --> CancelledBeforeDispatch : confirmed prevention of dispatch
Running --> Succeeded : actual operation-specific completion evidence
Running --> FailedKnown : authoritative known failure
Running --> Reconciling : partial / unknown effect
Running --> StopRequested : cancellation intent
StopRequested --> Succeeded : completion wins race
StopRequested --> StoppedConfirmed : actual facility stop evidence
StopRequested --> Reconciling : stop/effect unknown
Reconciling --> Succeeded : completion established
Reconciling --> FailedKnown : actual known failure evidence
note right of StoppedConfirmed
 Stop confirmation is separate from cleanup.
 Terminal job state is not reclaimed capacity.
end note

@enduml
